OL,3,GNEWSAFamily want answers over care
OL,4,Agiven to toddler who suffered brain
OL,5,Ainjury at birth
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 22-month-old boy died after
OL,8,Fdeveloping a severe brain injury during
OL,9,Fhis birth caused by a lack of oxygen,
OL,10,Fan inquest has heard.
OL,12,FNoah James Sullivan experienced
OL,13,Fcomplications after being born on 23
OL,14,FDecember 2023 at the Royal Glamorgan
OL,15,FHospital's Tirion Birthing Centre.
OL,17,FAn inquest into his death is set to
OL,18,Fexamine whether there were failings in
OL,19,Fhis delivery and resuscitation, with
OL,20,Fhis family also asking it to look at
OL,21,Ftreatment Noah received weeks before
OL,22,Fhis death.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
