OL,3,GNEWSAFamily want answers over care
OL,4,Agiven to toddler who suffered brain
OL,5,Ainjury at birth
OL,6,
OL,7,FCoroner Rachel Knight told a
OL,8,Fpre-inquest review at Pontypridd
OL,9,FCoroner's Court on Wednesday that a
OL,10,Ffive-day inquest to be held in 2027
OL,11,Fwould focus on events before, during
OL,12,Fand after Noah's delivery.
